
Command	Purpose
npx prisma migrate reset	Reset database and reapply all migrations
npx prisma migrate dev --name <name>	Create and apply a new migration
npx prisma db push	Push schema changes without migration files (prototyping only)
npx prisma migrate status	Check migration status
npx prisma studio	View/edit database data visually


# 1. Stop your server (Ctrl+C)

# 2. Reset and drop everything
npx prisma migrate reset --force --skip-seed

# 3. Push the schema fresh
npx prisma db push --force-reset

# 4. Generate Prisma client
npx prisma generate

# 5. Run seed with FORCE flag
npm run seed -- --force
# or
npx ts-node src/scripts/seedData.ts --force